    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nKnock Na Rea' is an attractive detached bungalow located within Dromiskin village, standing amidst extensive, secluded gardens on c. 0.46 acres. \n\nThe residence extends to 167.8 sq.m. / 1,806 sq.ft. approx. (excluding garage) and offers generous living space with light filled interiors to include a welcoming entrance hall, sitting room, kitchen/dining room, living room / office, three bedrooms (one ensuite), conservatory, utility room, bathroom and w.c. An added bonus is the integral garage which is fitted with shelving and the sizeable attic perfect for those needing additional space or storage. \n\nThe property has benefitted from a range of improvements in recent years including upgraded, modern bathrooms, a new condenser boiler and the replacement of the fascia, soffit and guttering. This home now offers a solid foundation for its new owners to further modernise and enhance the property, while adding their own personal style and finishing touches.\n\nExternally, the property is approached by a large driveway leading to an open forecourt, providing ample off-street parking. The property itself offers huge potential with mature, private gardens suitable for those wanting a quieter setting but being within easy reach of services and amenities. \n \nThe property is within easy reach of the M1 Motorway Junction 15 & Junction 16 providing convenient access to both Dublin & Belfast city ideal for commuters or those operating on a hybrid working basis. In addition, Dromiskin village offers convenient village amenities whilst the large town of Dundalk offers a wide range of transport options (bus & train), shops, bars/restaurants, Dundalk Institute of Technology, Marshes Shopping Centre, Dundalk Retail Park and IDA Business & Technology Parks. In addition, Blackrock village is a short drive away and boasts a seaside promenade with views of Dundalk Bay and the Cooley Mountains together with an array of specialty shops, cafes and restaurants. \n \nViewers of this fine family home will be instantly impressed. Early viewing is highly recommended!"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nPorch - \n\n\nEntrance Hall - \n\n\nSitting Room - 4.70m x 4.04m\n\n\nKitchen/Dining Room - 6.02m x 3.63m\n\n\nLiving Room - 3.81m x 3.16m\n\n\nConservatory - 5.51m x 2.17m\n\n\nMaster Bedroom - 4.30m x 3.87m\n\n\nEnsuite - 3.57m x 1.37m\n\n\nBedroom - 4.13m x 3.38m\n\n\nBedroom - 4.85m x 3.38m\n\n\nUtility Room - 2.98m x 2.66m\n\n\nBathroom - 3.16m x 1.79m\n\n\nW.C. - 1.75m x 0.90m\n\n\n - \nTOTAL FLOOR AREAl 167.8 sq.m. / 1,806 sq.ft. approx. (excl garage).\n\n"
      },
      {
